			"to": "western-civ/scriptorium",
			"why": "Charlemagne's drive to correct the church's books, which that frame describes, reached its song too: his Admonitio generalis of 789 ordered all the clergy to learn the Roman chant, which monastic scribes later wrote down in neumes."
